        <body>
            <div xml:id="d173">

                <pb facs="0157" n="153" xml:id="pg153"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.811/998: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lockhart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-06-29T15:00:00-04:00">June 29, 1938—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>407. Your 900, June 25, 10 a.m., Whangpoo Conservancy Board. The Department
                    authorizes you to associate yourself with your other interested colleagues in
                    recommending a settlement of the controversy as suggested in paragraph 2 of your
                    telegram under reference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
